    <item>
      <title>视频丨普京：感谢中方和习主席组织今天的俄中美元首会晤</title>
      <link>https://soulmove.github.io/daily-news-ai/?batch=smart-20261120-125622&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_969977ebd381</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261120-125622:evt_969977ebd381</guid>
